Subject: [PATCH] Fix seccomp configuration for Yocto builds

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]

Ensures seccomp is properly configured for Yocto build environment.

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index a374cc09..4c1edc13 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -20,21 +20,21 @@
 WITH_NVCGO   ?= yes
 WITH_LIBELF  ?= no
 WITH_TIRPC   ?= no
-WITH_SECCOMP ?= yes
+WITH_SECCOMP := yes
 
